{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Let's start tiling!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Would it be possible to tile aperiodically with only one shape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This problem, called the Einstein Problem from the German \u201cein stein\u201d meaning one stone, was unsolved for many years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In 2022, David Smith finally discovered the einstein tile!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550470/extras/EinsteinTile.png?t=1745360379\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is based on the einstein tile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Creative mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The imagination is limitless!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own original background image by laying einstein tiles as you wish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550470/extras/creative-mode.png?t=1745360379\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Puzzle mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fill the given frame with einstein tiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is a so-called jigsaw puzzle. There is no pattern, though.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550470/extras/puzzle-mode.png?t=1745360379\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Photo and Video Submission Guidelines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether for commercial or non-commercial purposes, you are free to use this game's footage in YouTube videos, live streams, or on websites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3550470?t=1745360379","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550470/0777e865b2833f1991fb3af322f6ea0ba9338473/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745360379","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550470/2bb53c7fe98ab182f653e57ca35207e554227cfc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745360379","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550470/2bb53c7fe98ab182f653e57ca35207e554227cfc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745360379","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Let's start tiling!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Would it be possible to tile aperiodically with only one shape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This problem, called the Einstein Problem from the German \u201cein stein\u201d meaning one stone, was unsolved for many years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In 2022, David Smith finally discovered the einstein tile!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550470/extras/EinsteinTile.png?t=1745360379\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is based on the einstein tile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Creative mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The imagination is limitless!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own original background image by laying einstein tiles as you wish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550470/extras/creative-mode.png?t=1745360379\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\